{"task_id": "Mbpp/2", "solution": "def similar_elements(collection1, collection2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Find shared elements between two collections.\n\n    Args:\n        collection1: First collection (list or tuple)\n        collection2: Second collection (list or tuple)\n\n    Returns:\n        tuple: Shared elements as a tuple\n    \"\"\"\n    set1 = set(collection1)\n    set2 = set(collection2)\n    shared = set1.intersection(set2)\n    return tuple(shared)"}
