{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) with base cases P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n\n    def _calculate(k: int) -> int:\n        if k == 1 or k == 2:\n            return 1\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        val_k_minus_1 = _calculate(k - 1)\n        result = _calculate(val_k_minus_1) + _calculate(k - val_k_minus_1)\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _calculate(n)"}
