{"task_id": "Mbpp/109", "solution": "def rotate_left(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Rotates string left by one position.\"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return s\n    return s[1:] + s[0]\n\ndef binary_to_decimal(binary_str: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Converts binary string to decimal integer.\"\"\"\n    return int(binary_str, 2)\n\ndef is_odd(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Returns True if number is odd.\"\"\"\n    return num % 2 != 0\n\ndef odd_Equivalent(binary_str: str, rotation_count: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Main function that counts odd values from rotated binary strings.\"\"\"\n    odd_count = 0\n    current_str = binary_str\n\n    for _ in range(rotation_count):\n        decimal_value = binary_to_decimal(current_str)\n        if is_odd(decimal_value):\n            odd_count += 1\n        current_str = rotate_left(current_str)\n\n    return odd_count"}
