{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\n\ndef _validate_indices(start_index: int, end_index: int, list_length: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Validate that indices are within bounds and start <= end.\"\"\"\n    if not (0 <= start_index < list_length and 0 <= end_index < list_length):\n        return False\n    if start_index > end_index:\n        return False\n    return True\n\ndef _calculate_range_sum(numbers: List[Union[int, float]], start: int, end: int) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum for validated range.\"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(start, end + 1):\n        current_sum += numbers[i]\n    return current_sum\n\ndef sum_range_list(numbers: List[Union[int, float]], start_index: int, end_index: int) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of numbers in list within specified index range (inclusive).\"\"\"\n    list_length = len(numbers)\n\n    if not _validate_indices(start_index, end_index, list_length):\n        return 0\n\n    return _calculate_range_sum(numbers, start_index, end_index)"}
