{"task_id": "Mbpp/270", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef _is_even_number(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determine if a number is even.\"\"\"\n    return number % 2 == 0\n\ndef _is_even_position(index: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determine if a position index is even using 0-based indexing.\"\"\"\n    return index % 2 == 0\n\ndef _calculate_sum(qualifying_numbers: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the sum of a list of numbers.\"\"\"\n    return sum(qualifying_numbers)\n\ndef sum_even_and_even_index(input_list: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find the sum of even numbers at even positions of a list.\n    Positions are 0-indexed.\n    \"\"\"\n    qualifying_numbers: List[int] = []\n    for index, number in enumerate(input_list):\n        if _is_even_position(index) and _is_even_number(number):\n            qualifying_numbers.append(number)\n    \n    return _calculate_sum(qualifying_numbers)"}
