{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(list1: list, list2: list, list3: list) -> list[dict]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Convert three lists into a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each element from list1 becomes an outer key, list2 an inner key, and list3 an inner value.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for outer_key, inner_key, value in zip(list1, list2, list3):\n        inner_dict = {inner_key: value}\n        outer_dict = {outer_key: inner_dict}\n        result.append(outer_dict)\n    return result"}
