{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the cube sum of the first n even natural numbers.\n    For n=2, this is 2^3 + 4^3 = 8 + 64 = 72.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_num = 2 * i\n        total_sum += even_num ** 3\n    return total_sum"}
