{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    It iterates from 1 to n, summing the cubes, then divides by n.\"\"\"\n    \n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += i ** 3\n        \n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    \n    return average"}
