{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(arr: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts the given array using the Shell Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return arr[:]\n\n    # Create a copy to avoid modifying the original array\n    arr_copy = arr[:]\n\n    # Start with a large gap and reduce it\n    gap = n // 2\n    while gap > 0:\n        # Perform gapped insertion sort for this gap size\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = arr_copy[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and arr_copy[j - gap] > temp:\n                arr_copy[j] = arr_copy[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            arr_copy[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return arr_copy"}
