{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates all possible combinations (power set) of elements from the input list.\n    It uses a binary pattern algorithm to ensure predictable and reproducible results.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    combinations = []\n\n    # Iterate from 0 to 2^n - 1 to generate all binary patterns\n    for i in range(1 << n):\n        current_combination = []\n        # For each pattern, check bits to include elements\n        for j in range(n):\n            if (i >> j) & 1:\n                current_combination.append(input_list[j])\n        combinations.append(current_combination)\n\n    return combinations"}
