{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is strictly smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Returns False if lengths differ or any element in tuple2 is not smaller than its counterpart in tuple1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        return False\n\n    for item1, item2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        if item2 >= item1:\n            return False\n            \n    return True"}
